OL,3,C'We will prove our innocence': Man
OL,4,CCity chairman vows to fight charges
OL,6,FThe chairman of Manchester City says
OL,7,Fhe is confident and intent in "proving
OL,8,Fthe club's innocence" after reports
OL,9,Fthe club has been found guilty of
OL,10,Fbreaching 100 Premier League rules.
OL,12,FKhaldoon Al Mubarak has written an
OL,13,Fopen letter to supporters after it was
OL,14,Frevealed the club had reportedly
OL,15,Fbreached more than 100 financial
OL,16,Fregulations following a four-year
OL,17,Finvestigation.
OL,19,FThe club strongly deny the charges,
OL,20,Fwhich span nine seasons from 2009 to
OL,21,F2018.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
