OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1790437687
OL,3,C'We will prove our innocence': Man
OL,4,CCity chairman vows to fight charges
OL,6,FThe chairman insists City's
OL,7,Fdetermination to prove its innocence
OL,8,Fremains "as strong as when this began"
OL,9,Fafter the news was announced on
OL,10,FFriday, September 25.
OL,12,FAl Mubarak revealed that he had
OL,13,Fdelivered the exact same message to
OL,14,Fhis own family, reiterating that the
OL,15,Fongoing Premier League process "still
OL,16,Fhas a long way to run".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
