OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1790437687
OL,3,C'We will prove our innocence': Man
OL,4,CCity chairman vows to fight charges
OL,6,FAddressing the frustration surrounding
OL,7,Fthe lack of public detail, the
OL,8,Fchairman explained that legal
OL,9,Fconstraints prevent the club from
OL,10,Fdisclosing specific details.
OL,12,F"There are so many things that I would
OL,13,Flike to be able to share with you to
OL,14,Fhelp you understand why we feel so
OL,15,Fconfident in our position," Al Mubarak
OL,16,Fwrote.
OL,18,F"But the strict confidentiality of the
OL,19,Flegal process and our determination to
OL,20,Frespect it means I cannot do that at
OL,21,Fthe moment."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
