OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1790437687
OL,3,C'We will prove our innocence': Man
OL,4,CCity chairman vows to fight charges
OL,6,FAl Mubarak pushed back against
OL,7,Fexternal speculation, accusing critics
OL,8,Fof attempting to "undermine" the
OL,9,Fclub's "momentum".
OL,11,F"While some people have been quick to
OL,12,Freach their own conclusions, and there
OL,13,Fis so much noise swirling around us,
OL,14,Fnothing has changed," he said.
OL,16,F"We have faced challenges together
OL,17,Fbefore and have prevailed. There
OL,18,Fremain many who want to undermine the
OL,19,Fmomentum of our Club. We will not give
OL,20,Fthem that opportunity."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
