OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1790437687
OL,3,C'We will prove our innocence': Man
OL,4,CCity chairman vows to fight charges
OL,6,FAl Mubarak, who has been at Manchester
OL,7,FCity for 18 years, urged supporters to
OL,8,Fremain united as attention turns back
OL,9,Fto football following the
OL,10,Finternational break.
OL,12,FThe Sky Blues face Liverpool at
OL,13,FAnfield in two weeks time and a
OL,14,FChampions League clash against Paris
OL,15,FSaint-Germain at the Etihad Stadium.
OL,17,FHe described both matches an
OL,18,Fopportunity to "celebrate the strength
OL,19,Fof the Manchester City family".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/5
